Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, old woman, what kind of mischief\Ndo you want to get into today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many options.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could stew up fresh\Nmeat until it's nearly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,falling apart and then stew it some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're either stew stands or\Nthere's not a lot to do around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to interrupt, but isn't\Nthis the Hunters Association?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, Jiminy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we have company.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be those hunters\Nthe Clear Flow Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,director said were coming\Nto challenge the stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you could give us\Na few pointers or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We even have materials prepared for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place used to be bustling with\Nhunter types just a handful of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then that one fella\Nconquered the right-hand path.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since he came back\Ncarrying the belongings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.38,0:01:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of his friends who starved\Nto death along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's been pretty quiet around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.56,0:01:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've scored more tasty knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.22,0:01:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow there's never been a\Nsingle monster attack here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while the middle and left-hand\Npaths have been attempted,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even after half a year of pushing\Nforward, there was still no end in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.54,0:01:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a tradition for hunters to\Nbring along red metal stakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.44,0:01:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before turning back, they put those suckers\Nin the ground to mark how far they got.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So yeah, basically when we stop seeing\Nthese, we've gone deeper than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.42,0:01:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to make it all\Nthe way to the very end,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I doubt we'll get a chance\Nto leave one ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.30,0:01:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can take the cart the Clear Flow\NLake director gave us the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got no use for that\Ndarn thing around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super-strong partner, Lamas!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.73,0:02:14.78,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.94,0:02:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.18,0:02:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got digital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing but.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can just see you. You can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a flash drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gather the talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a ton of.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.01,0:03:26.22,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,1)\fscx68\pos(408,54.4)}Yesterday's Enemies Are Today's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There aren't any Unasusu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has finally come to\Nwow them with my new powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm rank three, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Boxxo, care to explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.82,0:03:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a vending machine with\Na slick two-seater ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too large to be a shoe, unless\Nit's for Dog Mountain. Pity likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it for Boxxo and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could get used to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:04:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what manner of magic\Nthis is, but it's quite remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This car is technically a dispensed good,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means there's no\Ntime limit on this bad boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has four wheels, so maybe\Nit's some kind of covered wagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I've never seen one quite like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe they'll get the hint\Nif I change into a gas pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rank three way extended\Nmy telekinesis range.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm a smooth operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd\Nrealize my dream of burning
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rubber as a vending\Nmachine in another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see. Pretty clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:05:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beast that she is, Hulemy is remodeling\Nthe wagon so we can hitch it to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you make it a little brighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.26,0:05:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making stuff's easier when you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear wants us to open whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is when we make it\Nto the deepest point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll keep it safe until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Hulimi's knee-deep in a new\Nproject, she'll sometimes forget to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better tempt her tongue\Nwith some packaged goodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to work, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.86,0:05:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll take a short break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe my eyes when you suddenly\Npopped out that weird-looking wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you call that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A car!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an A car?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:05:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.82,0:06:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oof, I'll just have to let that one slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the wagon is done, I'll take\NHulemy here for a pleasure cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet it wouldn't take her\Nlong to learn how to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea how fast\Nour new Acowi can travel,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm certain it will\Nsave us a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though honestly, I wouldn't mind it,\Ntraveling with you for years to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, better keep at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy stayed up all night working.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And like always, she pulled it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't exactly get what's powering it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My butt isn't even getting sore from\Nthe vibration, which is pretty wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is way faster than an Unasusu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels nice on my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find it quite invigorating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxxo, our hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who's Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Popular now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a long trip, but\Nhopefully this makes things more enjoyable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We quickly got to the fork in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With our new wheels, the trip\Nwas off to a great start.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.47,0:07:33.22,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(319,295)\fs26\shad0\bord2}Day 2
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weapon maintenance,\Nchatting, smelling shoes.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.72,0:07:38.72,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(319,295)\fs26\shad0\bord2}Day 3
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone spent their time\Nhowever they saw fit.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.98,0:07:44.85,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(319,295)\fs26\shad0\bord}Day 5
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's the day I'm gonna beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they started taking two-hour breaks\Nevery day, which included sparring,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and whatever that is, to\Nhelp them stay in shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:08:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They stayed active, ate and slept\Nwell, And were mindful of their health.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.36,0:08:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The team was in tip-top shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For entertainment, I've been playing\Ncinematic masterpieces on my nav system.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.55,0:08:16.93,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\shad0\move(405,70,375,5)\frz-8.63\fax-0.19\fs15\c&H210F2D&\3c&H311E1B&}Cat World Game
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For those on the wagon, I provided card\Ngames and toys to battle the boredom blues.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made a fatal mistake, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hello to my little\Nfriend, the trap card. Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.82,0:08:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand a rematch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hundred four.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hundred five.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.21,0:08:49.13,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(319,295)\fs26\shad0}Day 7
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.14,0:08:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else notice we haven't\Nseen those red steaks in a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point, I don't think I've\Nspotted a single one since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we've already set a\Nnew record down this path!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:08:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've only been at it a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true, but perhaps our\Nspeed has made it possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that make any kind of sense, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever my pals are in\Ndreamland, I start hauling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go in a fast yet sensible\N80 kilometers per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I keep this up, which I shall,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll be partying in the\Ninner depths in no time flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there, something is approaching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they appear to be monsters\Nthough i thought there were
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,none to be found in here so\Nmuch for that theory what do we
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do now i shall lead the attack\Nand safeguard our journey
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please just sit back and relax\Nmaster boxo let me at him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coach seems we've got ourselves\Na bushel of eager beavers
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.46,0:09:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,makes sense they've been\Ntraining non-stop so they're
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,probably dying to let off\Na little steam not so fast
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.44,0:09:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something's off they might be the\Nhunters that went in before us
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy moly, it's Aka and Shiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before it's too late, we're done if\Nwe don't get some food and fizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg if I weren't busy dying.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.96,0:10:18.97,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20\pos(496,20)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, volume number six.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.08,0:10:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to Captain\NKerioyl and the Vice-Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both further up from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.66,0:10:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we've told a fib here and there,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I swear we're not working\Nfor the Netherlord anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know it's kind of an awkward\Ntime to hit you up for more favors,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.62,0:10:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but please help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, have mercy on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given their pathetic display, how\Ncould we refuse their request?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After what happened on the roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:11:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was suspicious that we had\Nsomehow helped Boxo escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He accused Sulream of the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We realized he was\Nplanning to get rid of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sulream transferred the whole family\Nhere, including our big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But breaking free of the Netherlord's\Nrestraint spell and then having
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no choice but to perform a transfer\Nleft her too drained to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.84,0:11:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.75,0:11:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so in the end she chose to betray the\NNetherlord We walked for a week straight
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with barely any food Because we knew our\Nonly hope was crossing paths with you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We left the others with even less food\NThey insisted this was the only option
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we've got to hurry. I don't\Nthink they'll be able to last much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're in Bokso's super-fast\Nday car That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll be there in a\Nflash Then I'm gonna nap
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we'll make it in\Ntime, so you can nap away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to show off the\Ndriving skills I honed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,during my nationwide\Nvending machine pilgrimage
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're creeping up on suppertime.\NI've covered a lot of ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the first road trip in another\Nworld almost ended in the first
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,car crash wait is this a wagon\Nor something hello there is that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you hello old friend you've\Nbecome another weird shape i see
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait if you're here where are
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the boys with us that's a relief
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're breathing. It's\Nnot too late. I breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We used a temporary sleep spell To\Nconserve what little strength they had left
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As they say, all's well that vends well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:13:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give them the same meal deal\NI gave the red and white twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't accept a handout from a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to drink it, Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't, you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't love the sentiment,\Nbut at least she spoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost impressive that she's sticking
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to her bigoted little\Nguns on hating humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took a long sip for you just to make\Nsure they didn't put any poison in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.48,0:13:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it means that much\Nto you, I suppose I could try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This alliance might be\Ninappropriately easy to pull off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it safe to say you guys\Nare done being spineless
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little cowards who do whatever\Nthe Netherlord tells you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That about sums it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.72,0:13:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget obeying and we\Ncan't even go near the guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd kill every last one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, we still can't defy Sulream\Non account of our son's predicament?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can vend\Nto change the bitter truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:14:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has Kai's life in her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just like us because you\Ncan't go back to the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.04,0:14:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we should stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I despise humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm human too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pixis?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are entirely different subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you refuse to trust\Nhumans, at least trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear on my very soul\NI would never betray you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.12,0:14:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you with all my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll cooperate\Nfor the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't expect me to get friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.90,0:14:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.86,0:14:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, my skin is crawling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But on the bright side, we turned\Na powerful enemy into an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That acar breeze is nice, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.36,0:14:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a funny feeling we'd be\Nthe ones riding on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a skosh over capacity now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we had to strap a twin or\Ntwo to the roof of the wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Boxxo, you've\Nreally outdone yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.26,0:15:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet driving at a max speed through an\Nempty field would be quite exhilarating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.02,0:15:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, I'm sorry for what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's bad enough that I tried to use you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I also betrayed my friends\Nand the people of the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't expect you to trust me again, but\NI swear my backstabbing days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.64,0:15:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, my son is still a factor,\Nso maybe swear was the wrong word.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.64,0:15:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what friends are for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose if Master Boxxo has faith\Nin you, I will too. We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.82,0:15:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has no reason to betray us so\Nlong as Sulream is on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust him, despite everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas and Co are ready\Nto forgive and forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But things are a little more\Ncomplicated for the former fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui? Pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for abandoning\Nand betraying all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.22,0:16:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it won't help,\Nbut I'm sorry as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same goes for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.74,0:16:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am also very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're misreading the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.30,0:16:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't the reason we're\Nstill upset with you whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui, it appears you'll have\Nto spell it out for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you too dense to\Nfigure out why we're upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts that you didn't trust\Nus enough to confide in us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we'd known what you were planning,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.06,0:16:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we would have tried our\Nhardest to talk you out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it had been a half-decent plan, we\Nwould have been right there with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.90,0:16:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, you chose to keep it\Nall inside and push us away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have also encouraged Shui's wrath for\Nhiding things, like my love of footwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are literally called\Nthe Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to be coy about\Nour problems or shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We deserve to know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, perhaps we don't need every\Ndetail about your amorous adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, for one, do need every detail\Nabout those amorous adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marksa must have dispensed\Na sense of humor for Hevee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, anyway, in short, Heavy,\NSwee, and Petty, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.06,0:17:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're grateful that you still\Ncare enough to get mad at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really means a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I asked for advice,\Neveryone just got loud and angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.24,0:17:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darling, we're not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about those amorous adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So ended the dramatic plot twist\Nwith a whole menagerie of fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's saying there are\Nno sore feelings left,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at least the Cap and his fools\Nare back on the right side of history.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.58,0:17:43.58,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(319,295)\fs26\shad0}Day 10
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Several days later, Captain Kerioyl and\Nhis fam were already on their feet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They even started training with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the Ice Lady, she's\Nsticking to Kai like superglue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not exactly being chatty, but at\Nleast she's not trying to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.68,0:18:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be on\Nyour guard, Magic Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of\Nlaunching an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I no longer serve the Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As such, I cannot afford\Nto make more enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.16,0:18:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I pick you swear\NI'll always be on your side, big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all that I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one way to turn a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty clear she'd never betray him.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.24,0:18:28.50,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(319,295)\fs26\shad0}Day 14
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our journey's going smoothly, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no monsters or roadblocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just us and the long, straight road.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.52,0:18:49.52,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(319,295)\fs26\shad0}Day 20
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cruise could have used some\Nblue skies and green fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's total darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other than the headlights and\Nthe warm glow of magic items.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.05,0:19:26.56,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(319,295)\fs26\shad0}Day 25
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.12,0:19:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an end, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's gotta be, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.59,0:20:01.09,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(319,295)\fs26\shad0}Day 28
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming or is that a wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was starting to think\Nwe'd never make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.80,0:20:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shame here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the middle\Npath was the right idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way to know if this really\Nmeans we've reached the Inner Depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eddie's devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.90,0:20:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to travel a whole\Nlot longer with Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.30,0:20:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we encounter any foes,\Nworry not. I'll take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of weirdness awaits?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm gonna try\Nto manhandle it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.28,0:21:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing any traps,\Nbut please be cautious. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying my best to make it open,\Nbut the thing isn't even budging.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Llamas' strength isn't enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.74,0:21:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perhaps there's some special step\Nwe must take to unlock it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That shape, it makes me think\Nthere's something that goes in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gave the doors the once over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the only things that stood out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were those wacky cavities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just gotta be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That perfectly matches\Nthat size and shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.60,0:21:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stratum lord coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:21:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a hot hunch brewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.78,0:22:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's screaming at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what those stratum coins are for.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.96,0:22:08.59,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Translation:\N{\fs18.5}Duane Johnson\N{\fs15}Timing:\N{\fs18.5}Edgar Cruz
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too big and hot.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.59,0:22:12.56,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Editing:\N{\fs18.5}Alicia Ashby\N{\fs15}Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Salem Alabanza
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.90,0:22:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a new story.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.72,0:22:17.60,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Final Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be a new story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.12,0:22:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait. I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.71,0:22:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.86,0:22:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.72,0:23:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs21\pos(372.2,298.8)}The Beginning of the End
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

